<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>The Timeless Charm of the Handheld DQ Sandwich</h2>
<p>Long before the invention of blended Blizzards or elaborate royal sundaes, the simple ice cream sandwich was the undisputed star of community parlor stops. The DQ Sandwich honors that pure simplicity: cold, dense vanilla soft serve sandwiched between porous chocolate wafers that offer a gentle cocoa bitterness to counterbalance the sweet dairy richness. Portable, mess-free, and priced at an unbeatable $1.49 (190 calories), it remains the ultimate guilt-free treat on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
<h2>DQ Sandwich vs. Dilly Bar — Same Price Range, Different Experience</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Format</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>DQ® Sandwich</td><td class="price-cell">$1.49</td><td>190 cal</td><td>Wafer sandwich — no stick, lightest</td></tr><tr><td>Dilly® Bar (Chocolate)</td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td><td>210 cal</td><td>Round soft serve on stick, chocolate shell</td></tr><tr><td>Buster Bar® Treat</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>440 cal</td><td>Soft serve + peanuts + fudge on stick</td></tr><tr><td>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</td><td class="price-cell">$2.39</td><td>230 cal</td><td>Classic cone — same soft serve, cone format</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2>Take-Home Multi-Packs &amp; Freezer Stocking</h2>
<p>Most DQ Grill &amp; Chill and Treat walk-in locations stock convenient boxed multi-packs (typically 6 or 12 units) in their grab-and-go novelty freezers. They keep impeccably well in home freezers for up to three months, making them a fantastic, portion-controlled snack for late-night cravings or after-school family treats.</p>
<h2>Value Assessment: The Ultimate Bang for Your Buck</h2>
<p>In an era of rising fast-casual prices, finding a high-quality branded frozen dessert for $1.49 is virtually unheard of. Clocking in at $0.50 less than a Dilly Bar and nearly a full dollar less than a regular soft serve cone, the DQ Sandwich proves you do not need to spend premium dollars to satisfy a genuine sweet tooth.</p>
