    <h2>Why Longtime Dairy Queen Enthusiasts Still Order It</h2>
    <p>Predating the modern franchise era, the DQ® Sandwich represents pure nostalgia. At $1.49 and a modest 190 calories, it lets longtime patrons enjoy the exact same comforting dessert profile they remember from childhood visits, completely free of artificial gimmicks or unnecessary sugar bloat.</p>

    <h2>DQ Sandwich vs. Other Novelty Treats</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Treat</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Format</th></tr></thead>
